<title>USA: TABLE-Comdial Corp Q2 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Comdial Corp Q2 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.13     loss	 $0.19</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,142     loss	 1,628</p>
<p> Sales		     29,379		   23,562</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,656		    8,566</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus for latest Q2 was $0.12 per share.  </p>
<p>6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.21     loss	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,813     loss	   443</p>
<p> Revs			56,234		   45,610</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,620		    8,378</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 results included income tax benefit of $219,000, while 1996 results included benefit of $736,000.</p>
<p>These tax benefits increased 1997 year-to-date earnings by $0.03 per share to $0.21 and narrowed the loss in the 1996 six month period to a loss of $0.05 per share from a loss of $0.14.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
